SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The tthhrr__sseett__nnaammee() system call is non-standard and is used by the 1:1
     Threading Library (libthr, -lthr).

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The tthhrr__sseett__nnaammee() system call first appeared in FreeBSD 5.2.

